@startuml
[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : reserve seats / create booking

PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAYMENT_PROCESSING : payment attempt starts
PAYMENT_PROCESSING --> CONFIRMED : verified payment succeeds
PAYMENT_PROCESSING --> PENDING_PAYMENT : payment fails / retry allowed
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : 15-minute hold expires
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLING : customer cancels
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLING : customer cancels
CANCELLING --> CANCELLED : refund succeeds or payment was pending
CANCELLING --> CONFIRMED : refund fails

EXPIRED --> [*] : release owned seats
CANCELLED --> [*] : release owned seats
CONFIRMED --> [*] : booking retained

note right of PENDING_PAYMENT
Expiry and payment completion both use an
atomic status transition. Only the winner
releases or confirms the reserved seats.
end note

note right of CANCELLING
Refund is performed before the booking is
persisted as cancelled; failed refunds
restore the prior confirmed state.
end note
@enduml
